02:00038424 00038430        	   519:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00038428 00038516        	   520:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
