                            	  2363: Burrower_AnimateDrawAndCheckCollisions:
02:000390F0 4EB90004A1D8    	  2364:     jsr     Anim_AdvanceAnimCounterAndSetObjPosForSpriteDescriptor
                            	  2365:     ; If state = 0, return.
